This code reads temperature and pressure data from the TDK ICP-10125 I2C sensor, applies calibration formulas, logs the data to a CSV file, and displays the values on the console. It handles errors during I2C operations and retries after 5 seconds in case of sensor-absent or bus-error conditions. The program also handles graceful shutdown by catching SIGINT and SIGTERM signals, closing the I2C file descriptor and the CSV log file before exiting.

