This code reads the Sharp GP2Y0A21YK0F IR distance sensor connected to GPIO17 as a digital input. It logs each read with a timestamp to the `distance_log.txt` file and prints "Feeder Activated" or "Feeder Idle" to the console based on the distance. The program handles errors when opening or reading the GPIO file, retries after a one-second delay, and cleans up resources on SIGINT or SIGTERM.

