This code implements the requested functionality using libgpiod and the i2c library. It initializes the I2C interface and GPIO with error checking, sets up a thread-safe interrupt handler, and handles SIGINT to cleanly shut down. The program accepts optional command-line arguments for the I2C address and threshold value. It reads the proximity value, compares it to the threshold, and appends the result to a log file.

