This code initializes the I2C bus, registers a signal handler for SIGINT and SIGTERM, opens the I2C device file, and enters a loop that reads pressure data from the MLX90819 sensor every second. It handles errors during I2C communication and device opening, and ensures proper resource cleanup on exit.

