This code reads the temperature from a TMP117 sensor connected to the I2C bus on a Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+ once per second, appending the readings to a file named `temperature_log.txt`. It handles sensor-absent and bus-error conditions, attempts to re-initialize the I2C handle up to three times on failure, and cleans up resources on SIGINT (Ctrl+C).

