This code continuously monitors the YL-83 rain sensor connected to GPIO17 and controls the L298N motor driver based on rain detection. It logs all relevant events and errors to stdout with timestamps. The program installs SIGINT and SIGTERM handlers to ensure safe motor stop and GPIO release upon termination.

