This code initializes the OPT3001 sensor on I2C bus 1, configures it for continuous conversion mode with automatic full-scale range, and reads lux values approximately every 100 ms. Each reading is appended to the `light_data.txt` file with an ISO-8601 timestamp prefix. The code handles I2C transaction failures and sensor-absent conditions by retrying or logging errors without crashing. It also performs a clean shutdown on receipt of SIGINT or SIGTERM by releasing the I2C bus handle, any driver resources, and closing all open file handles on every exit path.

