This code initializes the GPIO pins for the sensors and LED, sets up callbacks for reading the sensor values, and controls the LED based on the sensor readings. It also handles SIGINT and SIGTERM signals to cleanly exit the program. Make sure to install the `libgpiod` library before compiling the code.

