This code assumes that you have the `libgpiod` library installed and properly configured on your Raspberry Pi. The code initializes the TMAG5170 sensor, reads the magnetic field values every 100 ms, and logs them to a CSV file named `magnetic_log.csv`. It also handles sensor-absent or bus-error conditions by printing error messages to stderr and continuing operation. The program registers a SIGINT/SIGTERM handler that cleanly releases resources before exiting.

