This code initializes the GPIO pins for the touch sensors and LEDs, sets up signal handlers for graceful shutdown, continuously polls the touch sensors, updates the LEDs based on the sensor states, and records touch and release events in a circular buffer. On receiving SIGINT or SIGTERM, it performs a graceful shutdown, prints the contents of the log buffer, and cleans up resources.

