This code initializes the I2C and GPIO interfaces, checks the sensor ID, reads the raw heart rate value, applies a moving average filter, validates the beats-per-minute value, and logs the data to a file. It also handles errors and bus errors gracefully, retries transient I2C read errors, and ensures resources are released on all exit paths. The program terminates cleanly on SIGINT by closing the I2C handle, terminating the driver library, and closing the log file.

