This code initializes the BH1750 I2C light sensor and APA102 LED strip, continuously reads the light level, scales the LED brightness proportionally, and transmits the data to the LED strip. It also handles errors for I/O operations, sensor-absent scenarios, and bus errors. On receiving SIGINT, the program will gracefully turn off all LEDs and close file descriptors.

