This code initializes the Adafruit VL6180X sensor over I2C bus 1, reads distance measurements every 100 ms, and writes the timestamped readings along with "DOOR_OPEN" or "DOOR_CLOSED" to the `distance_log.txt` file. It also handles sensor-absent or bus-error conditions by attempting to re-initialize the sensor. A SIGINT handler is installed to cleanly release resources before exiting.

