This code initializes SPI, performs the reset sequence, verifies the sensor presence, and then enters a loop to read acceleration data at 100 ms intervals, logging it to a file named `vibration_log.txt`. It also includes graceful shutdown handling for SIGINT and SIGTERM signals.

