This code sets up SPI communication with the MPU-9250 and GPIO control using libgpiod. It reads angular rates and logs them to a CSV file. The code handles SPI and GPIO initialization errors, retries SPI communication on failure, and cleans up resources on SIGINT or SIGTERM. Note that you need to replace the placeholder comments with actual code to read data from the MPU-9250 and extract x, y, and z rates.

