This code initializes the GPIO library, sets up the solenoid control pins, and enters a continuous loop where it alternates between activating solenoid 1 and solenoid 2 for half of the 1000 ms interval, logging each event to dispense_log.txt. It handles GPIO library initialization failure and file open failures by printing error messages to stderr and exiting. A SIGINT handler is registered to gracefully deactivate both solenoids, terminate the GPIO library, and exit on Ctrl+C. The source code is meant to be compiled with the GPIO library linked via the -lgpio flag.

