To compile the code, use the following command:

```bash
gcc -o audio_led audio_led.c -lgpiod -lasound
```

To run the program, execute:

```bash
./audio_led [sensitivity_factor]
```

Replace `[sensitivity_factor]` with a positive number to adjust the sensitivity. If no argument is provided, the default sensitivity of 1.0 will be used.

