This code initializes the GPIO for the IR receiver, sets up an MQTT client to publish decoded commands, and processes incoming IR signals. It handles errors during GPIO and MQTT initialization, guards against pulse-buffer overflow, verifies the NEC checksum, and ensures proper resource cleanup on SIGINT or SIGTERM. Note that you need to install the `libgpiod` and `json-c` libraries to compile this code.

